<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola FEMSA raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola FEMSA raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said Wednesday that analyst Jose Urdan had raised his rating for Mexican bottler Coca-Cola FEMSA SA to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts closed Tuesday at 32.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
